{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of floating platforms, stubborn cubes, and brain-bending puzzles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, every step matters: one wrong move and you\u2019ll either fall, get caught by a cube with attitude, or watch the path literally explode beneath your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/5f203eab1e24ea541065430982da600c.poster.avif?t=1762099621\" width=100 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/5f203eab1e24ea541065430982da600c.webm?t=1762099621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/5f203eab1e24ea541065430982da600c.mp4?t=1762099621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/5c31589d132a617036b9ddcedcbc8dff.poster.avif?t=1762099621\" width=100 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/5c31589d132a617036b9ddcedcbc8dff.webm?t=1762099621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/5c31589d132a617036b9ddcedcbc8dff.mp4?t=1762099621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/4d611b6ac48d9e1a20cfc751942c7a0c.poster.avif?t=1762099621\" width=100 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as